        <property name="plainText">
         <string>Google photo users can download a takeout archive of their pictures as a single zip file.
Downloaded files have their 'mtime' modified by google to the time of download which isn't useful for organizing pictures.
Luckily these takeout archives contain a .json file for each picture with the original metadata.
This operation allows you transform that zipfile into a folder of picture with 'mtime' adapted using that json metadata.</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
     </layout>
